
% Bartender

a: vi | . ii iii V | vi | . V . . |
link: vi | . ii iii V | vi | . V . . |
a_cad1: IV | V |
In: $a*2
outro: $a*2
a_turnaround: IV | III |
Vr_a: $a*2 $a_cad1
Vr_b: $a*2 $a_turnaround
b: IV | I | V | vi . . V |
b_cad: IV | I | V | III |
b_turnaround: IV | vi | V | R |
Ch: $b $b_cad $b_turnaround
a_cad2: IV | V | IV | III |
Vr_c: $a*2 $a_cad2
bridge: vi | R |
instr: $b $b_cad
b_turnaround2: IV | vi | V | ii |
Ch_b: $b $b_cad $b_turnaround2
S: [D] $In $Vr_a $Vr_b $Ch $link $Vr_c $Ch $link $bridge $instr $Ch_b $outro
